atheque’s Armer Theater public screenings as free and open to the public.","source_url":"https://www.csun.edu/mike-curb-arts-media-communication/cinema-television-arts/cinematheque","source_title":"Cinematheque (CTVA) | CSU Northridge","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free and open to the public; use the public screening schedule and arrive early because seating may be limited.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-botanic-garden-school-tour","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"CSUN Botanic Garden school tour","title":"Arrange a Botanic Garden tour","subtitle":"CSUN Botanic Garden","notes":"If you are organizing a local K–12 or college group, contact the garden at least four weeks ahead to request a guided visit.","short_summary":"A guided academic-garden activity for eligible local school and college groups.","evidence_claim":"CSUN says its Botanic Garden tours for local K–12 and college schools are free of charge and should be arranged at least four weeks in advance.","source_url":"https://www.csun.edu/node/175651/tour","source_title":"Tour | CSUN Botanic Garden","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free only for local K–12 and college school groups; advance arrangements are required.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-library-visitor-computer-stations","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"University Library Visitor/Student Computer Stations","title":"Use a visitor computer","subtitle":"University Library Learning Commons","notes":"Bring a valid photo ID, ask Library Technology Services for a station, and use the two-hour session to research or work together.","short_summary":"A first-come public computer option in the Learning Commons.","evidence_claim":"CSUN provides visitor computer stations for community use; non-CSUN visitors may request a two-hour session with valid picture ID.","source_url":"https://library.csun.edu/services/alumni-community/computers","source_title":"Visitor Computer Access | CSUN University Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"No purchase is required. Visitors need valid photo ID; stations are first-come and campus users receive priority.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-library-public-scanners","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"University Library free public scanners","title":"Scan notes or finds together","subtitle":"University Library Learning Commons","notes":"Bring your own material or locate a non-circulating item, then use the free public scanners to save or email a shared reference copy.","short_summary":"A practical no-cost library activity for saving documents digitally.","evidence_claim":"CSUN states that visitors without a Library card and users of non-circulating materials may use the Library’s free public scanners.","source_url":"https://library.csun.edu/services/alumni-community/borrowing","source_title":"Guest Access | CSUN University Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free public scanners are available, with campus users and government-document users prioritized during busy times.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-library-government-publications","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"CSUN University Library Government Publications","title":"Explore government publications","subtitle":"CSUN University Library","notes":"Pick a local, state, or federal topic and use the library’s government publications access to compare sources and save useful documents.","short_summary":"A public-research hang built around government information.","evidence_claim":"CSUN states that free public access to government publications is ensured by law and that free reference assistance and scanning or saving are available to any library user.","source_url":"https://catalog.csun.edu/about/colleges/lib/","source_title":"University Library | CSUN Catalog","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free public access applies to government publications; ask library staff for help locating material.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-scholarworks-repository","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"CSUN ScholarWorks","title":"Browse CSUN ScholarWorks","subtitle":"Online CSUN institutional repository","notes":"Search for a topic, creator, or department, then trade links to an openly accessible paper or project for a low-key online study break.","short_summary":"An online repository for freely accessible CSUN scholarship.","evidence_claim":"CSUN’s ScholarWorks policy states that full-text items in externally accessible repository areas are available free of charge.","source_url":"https://library.csun.edu/sites/default/files/users/apweiss/csun-soar-policy.pdf","source_title":"CSUN Oviatt Library Self-Archiving and Repository Policy","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use externally accessible repository items; access is online and no purchase or admission is required.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kcsn-online-stream","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"KCSN 88.5 FM online stream","title":"Listen to KCSN together","subtitle":"CSUN public radio, online","notes":"Put on KCSN’s web stream while you work, draw, or cook at home, and use the station’s playlist as a shared listening prompt.","short_summary":"CSUN’s public-radio stream can be listened to online without fees.","evidence_claim":"The Daily Sundial reported that KCSN streams its music online with no fees.","source_url":"https://sundial.csun.edu/94574/arts-entertainment/kcsn-to-have-its-grand-opening-in-the-fall/","source_title":"Westfield Topanga prepares for grand opening for new KCSN station | Daily Sundial","source_kind":"student_media","source_published_at":"2015-09-09","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The station’s online stream was reported as having no fees; internet access is required.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
